* SPICE diode models for the Multicomp Pro MP017043 RGB LED (common anode).
* N fixed to 2; Rs kept from the datasheet fit; Is refitted to bench measurements.
* Measured on the bench with a 6 V supply, one colour at a time:
*   Red:   Vf = 1.923 V @ 19.64 mA
*   Green: Vf = 2.92  V @ 19.2  mA   (datasheet table said 3.2 V, curve said 2.1 V)
*   Blue:  Vf = 2.93  V @ 19.3  mA   (datasheet table said 3.2 V)
* The 5 mA points from the datasheet curves are no longer used.

.model LED_R D(Is=9.94e-18 N=2 Rs=5.2)
.model LED_G D(Is=1.39e-25 N=2 Rs=8.6)
.model LED_B D(Is=1.17e-25 N=2 Rs=8.6)
